<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#CuratedKnowledgeCollection> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#CuratedKnowledgeCollection> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A governed, evolving intellectual collection of assertions about one or more identified resources, whose publishable states are represented by fixed knowledge snapshots."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#CuratedKnowledgeCollection> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The collection is not a musical instrument, digital surrogate, software product, version, distribution package, or serialization. Those resources may be documented by or materialize parts of the collection while retaining separate identities."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#HeritageRecognition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#HeritageRecognition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#HeritageRecognition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heritage recognition"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#HeritageRecognition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/core#IdentifiedResource> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#HeritageRecognition> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#HeritageRecognition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A citable, qualified record that an accountable community, organization, or other agent assigned a stated heritage status to a resource under identified criteria and temporal scope."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#HeritageRecognition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Heritage significance is represented as an attributed and revisable status, not as an intrinsic or permanent class of the recognized resource. Different agents may issue concurrent or conflicting recognitions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#HistoricalClaimReview> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#HistoricalClaimReview> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#HistoricalClaimReview> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "historical claim review"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#HistoricalClaimReview> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/provenance#EditorialActivity> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#HistoricalClaimReview> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#HistoricalClaimReview> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An accountable editorial activity that reviews assertions about an entity's origin, attribution, custody, ownership, location, interventions, or other documented history and produces a distinct conclusion assertion."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#HistoricalClaimReview> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This class concerns scholarly object-history review. It does not replace PROV-O lineage for the computational or editorial processes that generated records."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "knowledge maintenance activity"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/provenance#EditorialActivity> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An accountable editorial activity that creates one fixed knowledge snapshot and records the assertions added to or removed from the preceding snapshot."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Removal changes membership in a later snapshot; it never deletes the assertion, its evidence, or an earlier snapshot from the scholarly record."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeSnapshot> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeSnapshot> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage> .
