<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeSnapshot> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeSnapshot> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An immutable state of a curated knowledge collection whose assertion membership, named graph, RDFC-1.0 canonicalization contract, and exact canonical N-Quads materialization are explicitly recorded."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeSnapshot> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Snapshot identity depends on declared assertion membership and graph identity. Its canonical materialization is an exact bitstream fixed by byte size and checksum; the snapshot resource itself is not assigned a self-referential checksum."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#addedAssertion> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#addedAssertion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivity> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#addedAssertion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#addedAssertion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "added assertion"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#addedAssertion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/assertion#Assertion> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#addedAssertion> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#addedAssertion> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Identifies an assertion present in the resulting snapshot but absent from the preceding snapshot, or introduced with the initial snapshot."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalMaterialization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalMaterialization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalMaterialization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeSnapshot> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalMaterialization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalMaterialization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "canonical snapshot materialization"@en .
