<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalMaterialization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#materializedAs> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalMaterialization> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalMaterialization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Identifies the one application/n-quads bitstream whose bytes are exactly the RDFC-1.0 canonical serialization of the snapshot dataset and whose byte size and checksum provide the snapshot's reproducible fixity anchor."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalizationProfile> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalizationProfile> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalizationProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeSnapshot> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalizationProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalizationProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "canonicalization profile"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalizationProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/core#IdentifiedResource> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalizationProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalizationProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Identifies the immutable RDF Dataset Canonicalization profile used to produce the snapshot's canonical N-Quads materialization."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#canonicalizationProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "MODAVIS 0.1.0 fixes this value to the dated RDFC-1.0 W3C Recommendation. The input dataset contains exactly one named graph identified by snapshotGraphIri; that graph contains exactly the outgoing assertion-record triples for every includesAssertion resource and no triples for assertions outside that membership. Snapshot metadata and canonical-materialization fixity statements are outside the input dataset, preventing self-reference."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#curatedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
